{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "fcb9fd71de0697fa1c6f8d4af5cff2033ae7861aade01187a41c50b5203bb12d", "ja": "そんな大和撫子を表現するため……\nこれより、舞を一差しご披露いたします！", "zh": "为了展现这样的传统日本女性……\n接下来，我将为您献上一段舞蹈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
