{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "2a080045110c7eac4097dad83c153da52f76e46d42b5735c4a6780c184ae87db", "ja": "王子様かぁ、どんな感じかな～。えっと……。\n「私と踊ってくれませんか？　ミズキ姫？」", "zh": "王子殿下啊，会是什么感觉呢～。呃……\n“愿意和我跳支舞吗？瑞希公主？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
