{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "a49a8f80c65263d49e93bd73050c29d6018210a25e8dda0a1b3e145267221158", "ja": "お、王子様が誘われるのですか！？　ええと……\n「真美姫、共に舞いましょう」", "zh": "王子殿下要邀请别人吗！？呃……\n「真美公主，让我们一同起舞吧」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1045_p", "source_sha256": "5f19366fc9115f096415ee85cb6afa656ac96513c9aa2269f53d401df1736a6a", "ja": "こらこら、遊びじゃないんだぞ。\nどうせなら、まつりの参考になる練習をしないと。", "zh": "喂喂，这可不是在玩啊。\n既然要练，就得练些对学习祭典有帮助的内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1046_021mat", "source_sha256": "71982b6a33d41b97ce373e0dc30365033cbab9bd7c68097d02c90b8c75a49b45", "ja": "大丈夫なのです。とっても参考になるのですよ！\nのびのびとした、自由な……自由な演技。", "zh": "没问题的。非常值得参考哦！\n这种舒展的、自由自在的……自由自在的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
