{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1058_021mat", "source_sha256": "3c3b29c87d606983f40f5458168112996ae23d911e4fb3cc110180f94b886c43", "ja": "……ほ？", "zh": "……吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1059_p", "source_sha256": "345798072254cb402c13efa8a4a8918f84158d71aa45bd138b36a0bb6e0bb760", "ja": "最終選考の台本を読んだ後、まつりが何か迷ってるよう\nに見えたから。……思い過ごしならいいんだけど。", "zh": "读完最终选拔的剧本之后，我看到祭好像在为什么事情犹豫。……要是我想多了就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
