{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1061_021mat", "source_sha256": "ef7e21ee40e67e637a0df38a604986d7fe1ce986b2292f5ca730695896f00f63", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n少しだけ、姫のお話を聞いてくれますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n能听公主说一会儿话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
