{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1063_021mat", "source_sha256": "e565004e1bb668aeca2d8a785347f5f9fde9a0d39ca420134353075a640db9c2", "ja": "その、台本のことで……姫はちょっぴり\n迷っているのです。ぐるぐるまつりなのです。", "zh": "那个，关于剧本……本公主有点\n迷茫了。脑袋里乱糟糟的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1064_021mat", "source_sha256": "df5e19bf514cf465cfad1eb08d4376cd0c77df66da1b66b5a2dc46fc5d6aa7da", "ja": "最終選考の課題、クライマックスのシーンに……\nアドリブを入れたくて。", "zh": "最终选拔的考题，高潮那场戏……\n我想加点即兴发挥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
