{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1071_p", "source_sha256": "31357a2c08fde6a0d2beb6f788c30f495d6975069c6a0a2d0b26a9069f678a56", "ja": "……確かに、悩ましいな。", "zh": "……确实很让人伤脑筋啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1072_021mat", "source_sha256": "8fbc978dc91a5488826ceefafc95f335bcc145b90e7e52db82ef778254241ba5", "ja": "今回の役、まつりはどうしてもやりたいのです。\n誰にも譲れないのです。", "zh": "这次的角色，まつり无论如何都想演。\n绝不会让给任何人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1073_021mat", "source_sha256": "3cff80053ae1788572cd62829bf2e8a2cdafb3b9f73f5635ebd2edacc77e9c66", "ja": "だって、あのプリンセスは……\n私たちの、憧れのお姫様だから。", "zh": "因为，那位公主……是我们憧憬的公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1075_021mat", "source_sha256": "c5b6dd2c21a61a4774263c36c36d05033a641267d1729229914a06f5aa35a6c0", "ja": "だから、後悔だけはしたくないの……。", "zh": "所以，我不想留下任何遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1076_021mat", "source_sha256": "f33fadc781985dac23b7accf96768a457b2e8c209fe23684823e42cebaf5cd7b", "ja": "というわけで！　ナイト様はどっちがいいと\n思いますか？　お姫様らしさと、まつり姫らしさ。", "zh": "所以说！骑士大人觉得哪一种更好呢？\n是公主的感觉，还是祭典公主的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1077_021mat", "source_sha256": "84f4a9953531c29f76b1f0246a7a62dbaa78867e866065fb540587d89f8c7e37", "ja": "聞かれても困ると思いますけど、\n参考までに、教えてほしいのです♪", "zh": "我知道就算问您，您可能也会觉得为难，不过还是想请您告诉我，给我做个参考呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1078_p", "source_sha256": "9ee59488807a5bb5c6a1237d8bfbadfe42ce520127b9c7c8c6c50665e1b6b506", "ja": "うーん、そうだなぁ。\nしいて言うなら……。", "zh": "嗯——，怎么说呢。\n非要说的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_1079", "source_sha256": "4e72bcbb65e529e091110238df52e81037178b8a6fdb98d0e9b7a3c2880b263d", "ja": "まつりの好きな方", "zh": "喜欢茉莉的人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2000_p", "source_sha256": "836b9b163e10ead2a90cde72192fbca49a6ee838fe69de337e934f5ed138d8b6", "ja": "まつりの好きな方、がいいと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得还是选喜欢小祭的那一方比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2001_021mat", "source_sha256": "50b03b7f2121a7df8040fc776d5ab316e10c52b2ff095b8ce5a8f338ebf6adde", "ja": "ほ？　えっと……その答えはズルいのですよ？", "zh": "诶？那个……这个回答很狡猾哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2002_p", "source_sha256": "69471c3d71eec1530c12ca2d8c96a96fe9c83aaf9b21057eab0d261afee993c7", "ja": "でもお姫様って、俺にとっては、まつりのことだから。\nお姫様らしいっていうのは、まつりらしいって意味だ。", "zh": "不过对我来说，所谓公主，就是指茉莉。\n说像公主，就是说像茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2003_p", "source_sha256": "1ccef55c1f66d5164b02d8ca43b2cd26efadab5a9b37608a2ed39949e8579cd6", "ja": "だから、俺が一番お姫様らしいと思えるのは……。\nまつりの好きな方だよ。", "zh": "所以，我觉得最像公主的……就是祭喜欢的人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2004_021mat", "source_sha256": "7bcd9ab1301a8edd5c074e33bc156ddc53e27319ab8601ccb5ebceb868282db1", "ja": "……。ふふっ、やっぱり……\n{$P$}さんは、ズルいのです。", "zh": "……呵呵，果然……\n{$P$}先生太狡猾了啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2005_p", "source_sha256": "9ed72c720f288f70a9fe68a759a47d5290a9fff153de1b9c8cdefdb4a6012233", "ja": "そ、そうかな？\nとにかく、どうなっても全力でフォローするから！", "zh": "是、是这样吗？\n总之，不管发生什么，我都会全力支持你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2006_021mat", "source_sha256": "131433fa302e69962d441a4713632d8478cc470470acce440f0e1d8715d60397", "ja": "うん……。ありがとう。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2007_021mat", "source_sha256": "605aafeef0f28bfc61e91087dc66cda68fc76822698597d5ba34cc087f19698b", "ja": "早速ですけど、とりあえず今すぐ、\nフォローをお願いできますか？", "zh": "虽然有点突然，但能请您现在先关注一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2008_p", "source_sha256": "937e1c59c5c8fab524123337266c4324e4f604df66082719b668580f4db7fe0f", "ja": "えっ？　今すぐって……\n今なにか起きたっけ？", "zh": "诶？现在就要……  \n刚才发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2009_021mat", "source_sha256": "a0feba9039ad97ebb70201cd8e8d2db3a4f70e8aca3a8cf0989890157843f892", "ja": "じつは、姫はもう一か所、ダンスを練習したいのです。\nでもパートナーがいないのです。壁の花なのです。", "zh": "其实，公主还想再练习一处舞蹈。不过没有搭档，只能在墙边当壁花了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2010_021mat", "source_sha256": "60fdd0c118f44af49fd880c8b29730f412adb83d1ef74e2e806ce9d2d40ca635", "ja": "つまり……。おわかりなのです？", "zh": "也就是说……明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2011_p", "source_sha256": "af5533d7fe326b29de48a04e826c8bf371f8ab8af5385ee3681232e1fc8a2c32", "ja": "つまり……。どういうことかな？", "zh": "也就是说……这究竟是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2012_021mat", "source_sha256": "e9e9071cc27f7320943b5df50ec4956f2bc83d672f07406249a3ee87e176b0f7", "ja": "……ふふっ。\nしゃる・うぃー・だんす、なのです！　ナイト様♪", "zh": "……呵呵。\n来与我共舞一曲吧，骑士大人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2014_null", "source_sha256": "254eb0c4612dbcc183553f903c8dba4f01912c1260b52f5c229d1837864071c1", "ja": "最終オーディション、当日……", "zh": "最终试镜，当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2015_oujiyaku", "source_sha256": "6754e84f03fffaa6a65c15b648388a0ae44f52648c2622e6541555b7be8a701d", "ja": "おお、姫！　こちらにいらしたのですね。\n舞踏会、最初の一曲が始まりました。ぜひ私と……。", "zh": "哦，公主！原来您在这里。\n舞会的第一支舞已经开始了。请务必和我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2016_021mat", "source_sha256": "9c484c403a9afa635e099ff21bb32667a576c51908f3c5356d92534dc89158da", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……王子様！　よかった、探しました。\n一番最初は、あなたと踊りたかったから。", "zh": "呼……呼……王子殿下！太好了，找到您了。\n因为最开始，我想和您一起跳舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2017_oujiyaku", "source_sha256": "d0320724e491489e2d044db3350a273f08e236c8721199ec53949501bf14595e", "ja": "……えっ？　あれ？", "zh": "……咦？奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2018_021mat", "source_sha256": "28f30eca640dea60d11dfc63a4637f3e9b4a4edff831e169abbc3ae8cd3d716c", "ja": "ただお待ちするだけの毎日は、もうウンザリです。\nだから……！", "zh": "每天只是等待的日子，我已经受够了。\n所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2019_021mat", "source_sha256": "d3a1e21df5573104c8999bce6bb7ff1c6ef057ff0336b1f14be77530208ee0c8", "ja": "シャル・ウィー・ダンス？　王子様！\nあなたをお迎えに参りました♪", "zh": "要一起跳舞吗？王子殿下！\n我来迎接您了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2021_butaikantoku", "source_sha256": "0971072e6edee2ce51f0b909ccd0288f719d24d81ff90eef03aee862c7ee6823", "ja": "ありがとうございました。\n……徳川さん、一点だけ聞かせてください。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n……德川小姐，请只回答我一个问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2022_butaikantoku", "source_sha256": "28702ca198c1729c3017ddf6dec01c7a937bb758b520913b39ab14e2377bf73c", "ja": "最後、完全にアドリブでしたよね。王子に誘われる前に\n姫の方から誘ったのは、どうしてですか？", "zh": "最后那段完全是即兴发挥吧。在王子开口邀请之前，公主主动先邀请了他，这是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2023_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e9627206ee45ad814cdd45cb7e35e9c5b3d0ae8e9d684f398b77615389bc673", "ja": "……まつりが知っているこの物語のプリンセスは、\nただ待っているだけの女の子じゃないのです。", "zh": "……在茉莉所知晓的这个故事里，\n公主可不是只会一味等待的女孩子哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2024_021mat", "source_sha256": "7b8e4be38c217aed52f1de16a2ce73b51360c699e8c00bb7726dbc94f54fd591", "ja": "自分で夢を叶えにいく強さをもっているはず……。\nそう思ったから、なのですよ♪", "zh": "应该拥有亲自去实现梦想的坚强……\n因为姬是这么想的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2025_butaikantoku", "source_sha256": "24783eb6ee937dbaf88de6bce0996e986b43c3dc44a0a6430cb554d0b613e1be", "ja": "……初代公演のプリンセスは、そういうキャラクター\nでした。私たちの歴史を大事にしてくれたんですね。", "zh": "……初演中的公主，就是这样的角色呢。\n看来她是好好珍惜了我们的这段历史啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2026_butaikantoku", "source_sha256": "f0ad42dc71019df5ea27e90cd96aba3daf944f1d69b0b1c7206a978855c56b7d", "ja": "あなたの作品への理解と、アドリブをやりきった\n勇気に、心から敬意を表します。", "zh": "我由衷敬佩您对作品的理解，以及完成即兴表演的勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_138_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_138_2027_butaikantoku", "source_sha256": "37b6b8112bd052d94dd22573319722c53bea42cf8f248acc3613928f71d0b6c5", "ja": "ありがとうございました。どうぞ、プリンセスの\n望むままに……ダンスをお楽しみください！", "zh": "非常感谢。请随公主殿下\n您的心意……尽情享受舞蹈吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
